BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Clips & Cocktails: AI Marketing Happy Hour with OpusClip
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261116T203000
DTSTAMP:20261111T063824Z
UID:funcheap-1646711@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerOpusClipMonday\, Nov 16\, 5:30
  to 8:30pm. ZOË\, 579 Howard St\, San Francisco. Free. Drinks and bites a
 re on us.\n\nIf you’re the one turning podcasts\, webinars\, customer in
 terviews and live events into the clips your company posts\, this night is
  for you. Pull up a drink for a fireside chat with Young Zhao\, CEO of Opu
 sClip\, and a special guest from one of the Bay Area’s top fintech brand
 s. They’ll get real about how AI is changing short-form: what’s workin
 g\, what’s hype\, and how lean teams are shipping more without burning o
 ut. Then stick around to swap notes with social\, video and content folks 
 who get your job. Nobody here will ask you to explain what a hook is.\n\nA
 lso on the menu:\nFree clips: Drop us a link to a webinar\, podcast or tal
 k\, and we’ll send back ready-to-post clips within 24 hours.\nWin Ray-Ba
 n Meta glasses in our end-of-night raffle.\nNo pitch. Just good drinks and
  better conversations.\n\nWho should come: social media managers\, video p
 roducers\, content marketers\, and community and field marketers at Bay Ar
 ea tech and finance companies. ICs and team leads welcome. Bring a teammat
 e. Spots are limited\, so RSVP to save yours.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://
 luma.com/4xcuvbn7\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/clips-cocktails-ai-mar
 keting-happy-hour-opusclip/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cover.
 jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T063824Z
LOCATION:ZOË\, 579 Howard St\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/clips-cocktails-ai-marketing-happy-hour-opuscl
 ip/
