 -focused nonprofit bringing people together through walking\, running\, ou
 tdoor exploration\, and social connections.\nOur mission is simple: create
  welcoming spaces where people can get outside\, connect with others\, and
  enjoy being part of a community.\nTWO CITIES. TWO DAYS. ONE COMMUNITY.\nS
 AN FRANCISCO\nEvery Tuesday | 6:30 PM\nOAKLAND\nEvery Thursday | 6:30 PM\n
 Lake Merritt\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n• Free weekly community walks and social g
 atherings\n• Opportunities to meet new people and build genuine friendsh
 ips\n• A welcoming environment for individuals of all backgrounds\n• O
 utdoor activities and community exploration\n• Refreshments and special 
 giveaways at select events\n• No membership fees or participation costs\
 nWhether you’re new to the Bay Area\, looking to expand your social circ
 le\, or simply want to enjoy the outdoors\, Open Air Club welcomes you!\nC
 ome alone\, bring a friend\, or invite your coworkers. Everyone is encoura
 ged to participate at their own comfort level.\nOur events are designed to
  be relaxed\, enjoyable\, and accessible to people with different fitness 
 levels.\nADMISSION: 100% FREE\nWe encourage attendees to RSVP through Meet
 up to receive event updates and meeting-location details.\nJoin our growin
 g communi...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://theopenairclub.netlify.app\nDetai
 ls: https://sf.funcheap.com/open-air-club-free-weekly-community-walks-san-
 francisco-oakland/\nSource: Funcheap SF
