SUMMARY:Las Migas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T230000
DTSTAMP:20261118T115305Z
UID:funcheap-1640865@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWith over 20 years of career a
 nd six studio albums\, Las Migas have become one of the most international
 ly acclaimed Spanish bands. They have performed in more than 50 countries\
 , including the United States\, India\, France\, Egypt\, Mexico\, Cuba\, I
 taly\, Namibia\, Jamaica\, Algeria\, Hong Kong\, Germany\, Chile\, Sweden\
 , Ukraine\, and Morocco\, among many others.\nThey have been nominated fou
 r times for the Latin Grammy Award in the Best Flamenco Album category (20
 16\, 2022\, 2024\, and 2025)\, winning the award twice. They have also rec
 eived the prestigious MIN Award in 2019 and 2023 for their albums Rumberas
  and Libres\, respectively.\n\nIn the spring of 2025\, Las Migas released 
 Flamencas\, a tribute to the essence and purity of flamenco. In this work\
 , the band evolves its sound toward a more contemporary expression\, wrapp
 ed in a powerful visual identity already showcased in the video for “Cel
 os\,” directed by renowned fashion photographer Javier Biosca. The recor
 ding won the Latin Grammy Award for Best Flamenco Album.\nDoors: 7:00 PM\;
  Show: 8:00 PM\nTickets: Advance Tickets: $44.00 (includes all fees)\; Day
  of Show Tickets: $49.00 (includes all fees)\n\n$44.00\n\nTickets: https:/
 /eventvesta.com/events/165444/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/
 las-migas/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/165444
 .jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:The Freight\, 2020 Addison Street Berkeley\, CA 94704
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/las-migas/
END:VEVENT
