UID:funcheap-1647368@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSAN FRANCISCO MEDICINE BALL BA
 ND: One of the most fun ensemble bands anywhere! The San Francisco Medicin
 e Ball Band is a legendary\, high-energy ensemble known for delivering irr
 esistible dance grooves rooted in Swing\, Jump Blues\, and driving New Orl
 eans rhythms. Swing dancers love the infectious energy of featured vocalis
 t Valeriana Q\, a long-time Bay Area favorite. Let’s all party! Website:
  https://www.medicineballband.com YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v
 =_6oEFN5f7FE&list=RD_6oEFN5f7FE&start_radio=1 WOODCHOPPER’S BALL: The Wo
 odchopper’s Ball\, San Francisco’s swing hot spot\, is a weekly Tuesda
 y night swing dance event held at the historic Verdi Club in San Francisco
 ’s Mission district. Named after the classic 1939 swing tune by the Wood
 y Herman Orchestra (and their biggest hit!)\, it features monthly classes\
 , a full bar (21+ only)\, and a dance party with a drop-in lesson and the 
 largest variety of live swing dance music in town! http://www.woodchoppers
 ball.com/ * LIVE MUSIC DANCE PARTY\, 9:00-11:30pm\, with a different band 
 each week! $20 admission (cash only\, please) includes a drop-in Basic Swi
 ng dance lesson (9:00-9:15pm)\, perfect for complete beginners (no partner
  required)! * FULL BAR & LOUNGE\, 8:00pm-closing (21+ only)! Enjoy a class
 ic cocktail in the swanky vintage bar and lounge! * 2\,500-SQ-FT DANCE FLO
 OR: Large\, beautiful\, hardwood dance floor with plenty of room to swing 
 out! * NOVEMBER (4-week) LINDY HOP and BALBOA monthly class...\n\n$20.00\n
 \nTickets: https://go.airhorn.events/r/Db3Eke\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/san-francisco-medicine-ball-band-woodchoppers-ball/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screen
 shot-2026-11-14-at-11.22.20-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:Verdi Club\, 2424 Mariposa Street\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-medicine-ball-band-woodchoppers-
 ball/
END:VEVENT
