SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerCJJoin us for a conversation w
 ith authors Paulina Borsook and Jonathan Weber on how right-wing tech cult
 ure influences global politics.\nPublished twenty six years ago and findin
 g new life\, Borsook’s book\, Cyberselfish: A Critical Romp Through the 
 Terribly Libertarian Culture of High Tech\, is an urgent warning the publi
 c has only just begun to grapple with. In tandem\, Weber’s book\, City o
 n the Edge: Technology\, Politics\, and the Fight for the Soul of San Fran
 cisco\, looks at the city’s transformation into a global capital of tech
 nology and how it might continue to evolve.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ta
 llyhobookstore.com/events/6582420261118\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/
