CATEGORIES:Literature
DESCRIPTION:Meet & Greet Book Signing Only • SF Ferry Plaza Market\n11:0
 0 AM PT Food Demo // 11:30 AM PT Book Signing\nPlease join us for a specia
 l meet-and-greet signing event with Ann M. Evans & Georgeanne Brennan\, fo
 llowing their Foodwise demo at the Ferry Plaza Farmers Market.\n\nAnn M. E
 vans & Georgeanne Brennan's beautiful new work\, Market Memories Cookbook\
 , celebrates 50 years of the Davis Farmers Market with 92 all-new seasonal
  recipes illustrated by the authors.\n\nFree\nBook Passage Presents:\n\nDe
