IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35226368/834421ab-05e9-4d0b-ac29-6f9e9b2a0140.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T193355Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/21/zhang-yimou-s-raise-the-red-lan
 tern-4k-restoration-tickets
END:VEVENT
