 maybe toast. Is Charlie Brown doomed? Not when Linus\, Snoopy and Woodstoc
 k chip in to save the (Thanksgiving) Day. With such good friends\, Charlie
  Brown - and all of us - have so many reasons to be thankful.\n\nMake it a
