 hanksgiving meal(s) in downtown San Francisco on Thursday\, November 26th 
 between 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM.\nDeliver the meal(s) and spend time visitin
 g with an older adult in their home.\nVisits and deliveries should be comp
 leted between 10:30 AM – 12:30 PM.\nExact meal pick-up location will be 
 shared in your confirmation email.\n\nOption 2: Meal Delivery Only\n\nPick
  up meals in downtown San Francisco on Thursday\, November 26th between 10
 :00 AM – 12:00 PM.\nDeliver meals to multiple older adults who have requ
 ested delivery only (no in-home visit).\nDeliveries should be completed be
 tween 10:30 AM – 12:30 PM.\nExact pick-up location will be shared in you
 r confirmation email.\n\nAdditional Details\n\nFamily and friends are welc
 ome to join you! At least one person in each group must have a cleared bac
 kground check and volunteer orientation.\n\nSign up today to make Thanksgi
 ving brighter for older adults in San Francisco!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https
