LOCATION:Legion of Honor\, 100 34th Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-legion-of-honor-museum-day-for-bay-area-r
 esidents-every-saturday-344/
