DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizerphoto by Jerry TomlinsonThe Gr
 eat San Francisco Crystal Fair is taking place at the San Francisco County
  Fair Building in Golden Gate Park. It will host the largest collection of
  crystals\, beads\, minerals jewelry and metaphysical healing tools that y
 ou’ve ever seen in our fair city. Thousands of items will be available a
 t excellent prices\, plus you can meet practitioners of the healing arts.\
 nOver 50 exhibitors will dazzle you with their vast storehouse of brillian
 t gemstones and shamanic wisdom. They include vendors from around the coun
 try and exotic places like Bali\, Nepal\, Afghanistan and China. Come expl
 ore the vast delights and many splendors of the Great San Francisco Crysta
 l Fair\n\nLocation: San Francisco County Fair Building 1199 -9th Avenue at
  Lincoln Way (just inside Golden Gate Park) Hours: Saturday\, November 28 
 10am to 6pm\; Sunday\, November 29 10am-4pm\nContact: Jerry Tomlinson (415
 ) 383-7837\n\n$11.00\n\nTickets: https://www.crystalfair.com\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-crystal-fair-nov-2728/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
