DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerEmporium PresentsBrad Williams
  is one of comedy’s most in-demand headliners\, known for his fearless\,
  high-energy stand-up and sold-out shows across the globe. A veteran perfo
 rmer since his teens\, he has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Jimmy Kimmel 
 Live!\, and more\, with acclaimed specials on Showtime and Netflix’s The
  Degenerates. Brad also made history as the first stand-up comedian to hea
 dline a Cirque du Soleil production\, leading the hit Las Vegas show Mad A
 pple. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of sharp\, unfiltered comedy.\
 nOn Sale Now!\n\nTickets are available online at:\nhttps://www.ticketmaste
 r.com/event/1C0064447F855D44\nAll Ages | Reserved\nDoors at 6:00 PM | Show
  at 7:00 PM\nFor more information about the artist\, please visit:\nhttps:
