DESCRIPTION:Come find your snuggle buddy\, your winter fling\, or your fuc
 k buddy for the cold months ahead.\n\nNetfux and Chill: Cuffing Season at 
 The Kink Store\nHosted by Danarama\nSat 11/28 · 7pm–midnight · The Kin
 k Store\, 224 6th St\, SF\n\nThanksgiving is passed\, the leftovers won't 
 last\, and your non-chosen families are leaving at last. The nights are ge
 tting longer\, the air is getting colder\, and everyone's looking for some
 one to keep them warm. Welcome to cuffing season.\nCome find your snuggle 
 buddy\, your Winter fling\, or your fuck buddy for the cold months ahead. 
 The Kink Store is turning into one big cozy den: piles of pillows\, warm r
 ed light\, hot tasty drinks and snacks\, and "Netfux" playing on the big s
 creen. Bring your partner(s)\, or come solo and see who you end up cuddled
  up with. They'll be meet-mixer games\, bondage basics demos and tastings\
 , plenty of room to practice and play\, and Kink Store toys to try or to b
 uy (with lingering Black Friday deals).\n\nCome\, get comfy\, get close\, 
 and get cuffed.\n\n$48.24 to $90.24\nDanarama\n\nTickets: https://kinkpres
 ents.com/e/73a817a8-90fd-4326-9f18-ad6e70b43522\nDetails: https://dothebay
