DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFirst Tuesdays Free Comedy Sho
 wcase & Happy Hour | The Layover\n16th & Broadway\nEvery month\, First Tue
 sdays Comedy brings you a lineup of comedians from HBO\, Showtime\, Comedy
  Central and late night TV – for free.\nThrow in happy hour drink specia
 ls until show time\, and you’ve got one fun night. Catch a lineup of gre
 at comedians from top clubs.\n\nFirst Tuesdays Free Comedy Showcase & Happ
 y Hour\nEvery First Tuesday | 8 pm to 10 pm\nThe Layover\, 1517 Franklin S
 treet\, Oakland\nFREE with an RSVP\nHosted by:\n\nLyall Behrens (Stand Up 
 appeared on Hulu\, Opened for Paul Mooney and Ali Wong\, Laugh Factory)\nF
 rancesca Fiorentini (Host of Newsbroke on AJ+. Correspondent with National
