DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerHometown Free Comedy Night & H
 appy Hour | Emeryville\nHometown Free Comedy Night\nCome for the comedy an
 d stay to take a picture with the legendary “What’s My Favorite Word?
 ”\nHometown Comedy is a free monthly stand up comedy show. It’s the on
 ly show in the Bay Area in a venue with artwork dedicated to Too Short and
  Mac Dre.\n\nEvery first Wednesday of the month\, comedians Dauood Naimyar
  and Rahul Pandya bring you the best stand-up comedians at Hometown Heroes
  bar in Emeryville.\nHometown Free Comedy Night & Happy Hour\nEvery first 
 Wednesday | Show starts at 8 pm\nHometown Heroes\, 4000 Adeline St\, Emery
 ville\nFREE with an RSVP\nThe bar features exclusive drink specials just f
 or comedy night as well as a menu of modernized Filipino classics like kar
 e kare and lumpia.\n– Updated 7/6/19 – Event info last checked via web
 site\n\nUpcoming Hometown Free Comedy Night & Happy Hour | Emeryville Even
 ts\nWed 10/7 Hometown Free Comedy Night & Happy Hour | EmeryvilleWed 11/4 
