SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Nature
DESCRIPTION:Bayfolk BotanicalsJoin Bayfolk Botanicals for A Yuletide Gathe
 ring\, a neighborhood holiday pop-up celebrating the beauty of winter\, th
 e natural world\, and the season of giving.\nSpend a winter morning explor
 ing a seasonal collection of fresh flower bouquets\, fragrant evergreen wr
 eaths\, garlands\, holiday floral arrangements\, and paperwhite and amaryl
 lis planters. Inspired by the woods and the changing seasons\, our offerin
 gs bring a little of the outdoors into the warmth of home.\nYou’ll also 
 discover our handcrafted collection of winter and holiday inspired botanic
 al fragrances. Made with thoughtfully selected essential oils\, these seas
 onal scents capture the warmth\, spice\, and evergreen character of winter
 . Explore eau de parfums\, botanical body oils\, aromatic incense\, room a
 nd linen sprays\, and a special Winter Solstice Smudge Spray. Lovely littl
 e gifts for others or something special to enjoy yourself.\n\nWe’re espe
 cially excited to share our limited edition Bernal Heights 2026 ornament\,
  featuring our neighborhood’s resident family of Great Horned Owls. A sm
 all keepsake celebrating the wildlife\, natural beauty\, and sense of plac
 e that make Bernal Heights so special.\nThis gathering marks Bayfolk Botan
 icals’ very first pop-up\, and we’d love to celebrate the beginning of
  this little venture with our neighbors. Whether you’re searching for a 
 thoughtful handmade gift\, bringing home fresh flowers for the holidays\, 
 or simply passing by on your morning walk\, we hope you’ll stop in and..
 .\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/a-yuletide-gathering-ba
 yfolk-botanicals-holiday-pop-up-tickets-2005207021179?aff=ebdsshother&amp\
 ;utm_share_source=listing_android&amp\;sg=507e0edea04339e31363be8c779a530a
 4c44d0f0915f12097dbc3bff456330910470aa6533613117ccd6a9e21b72e759d5e34c7a18
 97cee913417247546d85ba8bbe36bd41de63472424da5634\nDetails: https://sf.func
 heap.com/yuletide-gathering-bayfolk-botanicals-holiday-popup-sf/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
