DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMirthquake: Monday Live Comedy
  in the Richmond w/ $5 Drinks (SF)\nJesse Hett\nLooking for a great way to
  kick off your week? Look no further than Mirthquake: Monday Live Comedy i
 n the Richmond! This live stand-up comedy show\, held every Monday at the 
 Abbey Tavern\, is the perfect way to start your week off with a bang.\nFea
 turing a hand picked rotating cast of top comedians from the Bay Area and 
 beyond with credits like HBO\, Netflix\, Late Night\, and more\, Mirthquak
 e offers a night of non-stop laughter that will leave you feeling uplifted
  and refreshed. Hosted by the hilarious trio of Ben Kolina (Doug Loves Mov
