DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerDark Parlour SocietyGlue Stick
  Social is a free junk journaling and movie night at Spire\, an old church
  in West Oakland. On Wednesday\, December 9 we’re watching Santa Claus C
 onquers the Martians (1964)\, the cult holiday oddity in which Martians ki
 dnap Santa to bring toys to their television-obsessed children\, set in gl
 oriously strange Space Age design. At the tables: make a Martian headband 
