DESCRIPTION:After Dark: Unplug and Play\nThursday\, December 10 | Explorat
 orium\, Pier 15\n\nRecharge your winter wonder with a night at the Explora
 torium. Put your phone away and connect IRL—learn something new at scien
 ce trivia\, make art together at our offline hangout corner\, and don’t 
 miss 650+ exhibits that dive into the awesome experience of being human. P
 lus\, our annual winter exhibition Glow returns with radiant artworks grea
 t and small—get ready to be dazzled and surprised!\n\nAfter Dark Thursda
 y Nights\nThis event is part of our After Dark Thursday Nights series. Unp
 lug and play with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring science\, art\, and 
 perception. Learn more.\n\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (Ages 18+)\nThe Explor
 atorium\, Pier 15\, San Francisco\n\n18+\n\nTickets: https://www.explorato
 rium.edu/visit/calendar/after-dark-unplug-play-dec2026\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/12/10/after-dark-unplug-and-play-tickets\nSource: 
