 s d’oeuvres.\n\nTickets are limited and selling fast — reserve yours b
 efore they are gone!\n\nGeneral Admission tickets: $45\nIncludes:\n\nDelic
 ious treats and cocktails for purchase from Off the Grid food trucks and b
 ars\nLive DJ sets by In Session all night\nLive music by Radio Gatsby\nSty
 led photo booth by Photographer and Artist Anna-Alexia Basile\nAccess to A
 zzedine Alaïa: Sculpting Fashion and the Legion of Honor’s permanent co
 llection galleries\nAdmission starts at 7 pm\n\nVIP tickets: $350\nInclude
 s all of the above\, and:\n\nEarly entry at 5:30 pm\nCurator-led tour and 
 private champagne toast\nExclusive VIP lounge with open bar\, and vermouth
  tasting experience with Museion Napa\nCatered hors d’oeuvres with a spe
 cialty Hog Island Oyster Co. bar\n\nEvent details\n\nGuests must be 21+ ye
 ars of age.\nTicket includes access to Azzedine Alaïa: Sculpting Fashion 
 and the Legion o...\n\n$45\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://www.famsf.org/events/
