 nd of a decked-out Davies Symphony Hall\, filled with giant lit trees\, wr
 eaths\, and garlands. While you’re here\, sip a gingerbread old-fashione
 d\, toast with sparkling wine\, enjoy holiday desserts\, and swing by the 
