 galleries\, and community hubs in Oakland\, Berkeley\, and beyond. Come cu
 rious — meet the creative minds behind the work\, experience art where i
 t’s made\, and leave inspired.\nJust in time for the holidays\, it’s a
 lso a wonderful opportunity to shop locally and find one-of-a-kind gifts d
 irectly from the artists who make them. Not sure where to start? Explore o
 ur Emerging Artists\, Community Hubs\, or find your favorite artwork using
  our Artist Directory!\n️ Open Studios: Dec 5-6 and 12-13\; 11am–5pm d
 aily\nArt in your neighborhoods across the East Bay\nGet your free ticket:
