DESCRIPTION:SF Holiday Maker’s Market at the Museum of the Eye (Dec. 12-
 13)\nAmerican Academy of Ophthalmology\n\nMark your calendars for the Muse
 um of the Eye’s December event: the Holiday Maker’s Market!\n\nA weeke
 nd of local artisans\, hands-on crafts\, and holiday cheer. Shop unique go
 ods from local makers\, find one-of-a-kind gifts\, and get creative with a
  variety of crafts featuring eye symbolism in honor of St. Lucy’s Day\, 
 the patron saint of eyes. More details TBA.\nHoliday Maker’s Market\nSat
 urday & Sunday\, December 12-13\, 2026 | 10a-4p\nTruhlsen-Marmor Museum of
  the Eye\, 645 Beach St.\, SF\nFREE Admission – access to all of the mus
 eum’s permanent galleries & to the educational St. Lucy’s Day crafts\;
  Items will be purchased form the local artisans directly.\nSee what’s i
 n store for the event and learn about the vendors at www.aao.org/museum-ev
 ents.\n\nUpcoming SF Holiday Maker’s Market at the Museum of the Eye (De
 c. 12-13) Events\nSat 12/12 SF Holiday Maker’s Market at the Museum of t
 he Eye (Dec. 12-13)Sun 12/13 SF Holiday Maker’s Market at the Museum of 
 the Eye (Dec. 12-13)Disclaimer: Please double check event information with
  the event organizer as events can be canceled\, details can change after 
 they are added to our calendar\, and errors do occur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: 
 https://www.aao.org/museum-events\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-hol
 iday-makers-market-at-the-museum-of-the-eye-dec-12-13/\nSource: Funcheap S
