 gue.\nMaking Custom Holiday Decorations: there will be ribbons\, plastic c
 rystals\, glue guns\, stick-on gems\, and a small spray paint booth to tur
 n old toys into cool ornaments and decor to take home!\n​Look out for a 
 live Blacksmithing Demo by Maxon Zorro\, also bringing original jewelry.\n
