 e evening will feature music\, drag\, visual art\, festive food and drinks
 \, and dancing – while raising vital funds for the Center’s Cultural P
 rograms and LGBTQ+ artists.\nJoin us on Friday\, December 18 to kick off t
 he Holidays at the SF LGBT Center!\n\nGet your tickets for Belles and Beau
 s here!\nFriday\, December 18 2026 | 6–9:30 p.m.\nSF LGBT Center\, San F
 rancisco\nSliding Scale tickets starting at $10!\nDrag | Music | Dancing |
  Festive Food & Drinks | Art\n​​​We’re inviting partners and colla
 borators to help bring this joyful\, community-centered celebration to lif
 e through sponsorship\, in-kind support\, promotion\, and creative partici
 pation. Got questions about Belles & Beaus\, or want to get involved?\nEma
 il us at donations@sfcenter.org!\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.sfcente
