BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:24th Annual “Unsilent Night” SF’s Boombox Xmas Parade in The
  Mission (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T200000
DTSTAMP:20261116T194027Z
UID:funcheap-1344001@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Unsilent NightUnsilent Night is a participatory sound artwork 
 by composer Phil Kline\, an ethereal\, electronic soundscape played by the
  audience on boomboxes carried through city streets.\nEach participant get
 s one of four tracks of music in the form of a MP3 or through the app. All
  four tracks played simultaneously comprise Unsilent Night.\nThere are fou
 r different events in 2026! Two in SF (including the biggest/original one 
 in the Mission)\, plus new ones in Berkeley and Healdsburg!\n\nBring a boo
 mbox\, portable speaker\, or anything that amplifies music\, loaded with o
 ne of the piece’s four tracks. When we’re all assembled\, we’ll push
  play in unison and walk through the Mission back alleys as the piece unfo
 lds.\nDownload the tracks or download the app at: unsilentnight.com/partic
 ipate\n(PLEASE DOWNLOAD PRIOR TO MEETING UP)\n\nSAN FRANCISCO\n24th Annual
  Unsilent Night San Francisco – THE MISSION – The Original & Biggest\n
 !!\nFriday\, December 18\, 2026 | 6:30p\nMeet at Dolores Park\, 18th and D
 olores\, San Francisco\nFREE\n\nPlease arrive at Mission Dolores Park (by 
 the tennis courts at the corner of 18th & Dolores) by 6:30 pm\, ready to 
 “Hit Play” for the liftoff! (typically about 20 minutes later\, but ti
 mes are TBD – you want to be there early!)\nWe will complete the 60 minu
 te stroll back at Mission Dolores Park.\nThis is a free\, public event for
  all ages. The more participants\, the better it sounds\, so please invite
  your friends.\n\nBONUS SAN FRANCISCO EVENT FOR 2026 – MARINA\nWednesday
 \, December 16...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.unsilentnight.com/schedu
 le/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/unsilent-night-sf-mission/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/309016
 107_403499631942293_5723946376742609317_n-e1669743930698.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261116T194027Z
LOCATION:Mission Dolores Park\, Dolores St.\, and 19th St.\, San Francisco
 \, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/unsilent-night-sf-mission/
END:VEVENT
