 teerism\,Festivals / ParadesCost: $15+Link: https://www.firstnightmonterey
 .org/Hello\,First Night Monterey is preparing for its 34th annual New Year
 's Eve Community Celebration of the Arts - Color the Night! - on Thursday\
 , December 31\, 2026\, from 3 p.m. to midnight in historic downtown Monter
 ey. We'd appreciate your help sharing this family-friendly\, alcohol-free 
 celebration with your members\, residents\, customers\, and community. The
  event brings together live music\, dance\, cultural performances\, visual
  arts\, and hands-on creative activities for all ages.Could you please inc
 lude First Night Monterey 2027 in an upcoming member newsletter\, communit
 y email\, event calendar\, or social media post? If you have a deadline or
  preferred submission format\, we'd be happy to accommodate it.Event:First
  Night Monterey 2027 - Color the Night!When:Thu.\, Dec. 31\, 3 p.m.-midnig
 htWhere:Historic Downtown Monterey / Monterey Conference CenterInformation
  & tickets:www.firstnightmonterey.orgWe can provide a poster\, event image
 \, or shorter calendar description. Thank you for helping bring our commun
 ity together through the arts!Warm regards\,First Night Monterey\n\nPublis
 hed by KGO\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, OD
 bL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://www.firstnightmonterey.org/?utm_source=caldisco
 very&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
