  the event by the Hubba Hubba Revue staff. Individuals and groups with odd
  numbers may be seated together and share tables. Large parties are encour
 aged to buy tickets as a single purchase.\n\nPizza Special: A table for fi
 ve\, admission for five\, and a large two topping pizza!\n\nFront Row VIP:
  A table for five right in front of the stage\, including admission for fi
 ve and bottle service!\n\nVIP Booths: These are against the wall\, downsta
