BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Final Day to Ice Skate at Union Square’s Holiday Ice Rink (2026/
 27 Winter Season)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T230000
DTSTAMP:20261029T010145Z
UID:funcheap-1590595@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Holiday Ice Skating Rink at Union Square (2026-27)\nUni
 on Square Ice Rink\nOne of San Francisco’s favorite holiday traditions r
 eturns for its 19th season. The Safeway Holiday Ice Rink in Union Square o
 pens November 4\, 2026\, bringing outdoor ice skating to the heart of down
 town San Francisco through January 18\, 2027.\nSkate beneath the holiday l
 ights in Union Square\, with themed nights throughout the season ranging f
 rom ’80s music and country glam to a silent disco on ice.\nThe rink is o
 pen daily\, with hour-long skating sessions starting every 90 minutes. Thi
 s year’s lineup includes returning favorites like Drag on Ice\, Silent S
 kate\, Flashback Fridays and Polar Bear Skate\, plus a new series of Wedne
 sday night themed skating sessions. Tickets are on sale now at unionsquare
 icerink.com.\n\nSpecial Events at the Union Square Ice Rink\nOpening Celeb
 ration\nWednesday\, November 4\, 2026 | 5-7 p.m.\nThe season kicks off wit
 h an evening celebration and on-ice performances. The first 100 guests can
  skate for free during the 5:30 p.m. and 7 p.m. sessions. Registration is 
 required upon arrival.\nFlashback Fridays\nNovember 27\, December 18\, 202
 6\, and January 15\, 2027 | 7 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. sessions\nSkate to 1980s 
 hits with music from Greatest Hits 103.7. Expect throwback tracks from art
 ists like Madonna\, Michael Jackson\, Queen\, Prince and Pat Benatar.\nDra
 g on Ice\nThursday\, December 3\, 2026 | 6:30-8 p.m. | $35\nLocal drag per
 formers bring their show to the ice for an evening of skating and live ent
 ...\n\n$22.00\n\nTickets: http://unionsquareicerink.com/union-square-ice-s
 kating/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/final-day-to-ice-skate-at-union-
 squares-holiday-ice-rink/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Union-
 Square-Ice-Rink_Aerial-at-Night.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T010145Z
LOCATION:Union Square Park\, Geary and Powell\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/final-day-to-ice-skate-at-union-squares-holida
 y-ice-rink/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Lift Every Voice” Free MLK Day Gospel/Blues Concert at SF’s
  Castro Theatre (2027)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270118T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:funcheap-1641701@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Lift Every Voice 2027: Free MLK Day Singer Showcase (Castro Th
 eatre)San Francisco International Arts Festival presents Lift Every Voice:
  A Singer Showcase\, a free MLK Day concert at the Castro Theatre celebrat
 ing Black music traditions including gospel\, blues and jazz. The program 
 features the Dee Spencer Trio\, guest vocalist and MC Clairdee\, and 17 co
 mmunity singers\, with bassist Jewell McMillon and drummer Ruthie Price.\n
 Original Event Description:\nSFIAF Celebrates the MLK Bank Holiday with\nL
 ift Every Voice: A Singer Showcase\nat The Castro Theatre\nFeaturing The D
 ee Spencer Trio with Clairdee and 17 Community Singers\nCalendar Editors P
 lease Note\nWho: Dee Spencer Trio\, Clairdee & Community Singers\nWhat: Li
 ft Every Voice: A Singer Showcase\nWhere: Castro Theatre\n429 Castro St\, 
 San Francisco\, CA 94114\nDate:Monday January 18\, 7:00pm\nTickets: FREE\n
 Box Office and Information: https://www.sfiaf.org/2027_lift_every_voice or
  415-399-9554\n\nSan Francisco: San Francisco International Arts Festival 
 (SFIAF) is pleased to announce the 2027 rendition of Lift Every Voice: A S
 inger Showcase. This free to the public concert celebrates the Martin Luth
 er King\, Jr. Bank Holiday with Black music rooted in traditions such as g
 ospel\, blues and jazz. The program is designed to provide opportunities f
 or members of the community to engage with professional singers and musici
 ans in the exploration of Black/African American music. Featuring the Dee 
 Spencer Trio (led by Dr. Dee) with special guest vocalist...\n\nFree\n\nTi
 ckets: https://www.sfiaf.org/2027_lift_every_voice\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/lift-voice-free-mlk-day-gospelblues-concert-sfs-castro-theatre-
 2027/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/lev_we
 bpage.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T185326Z
LOCATION:Castro Theatre\, 429 Castro St.\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lift-voice-free-mlk-day-gospelblues-concert-sf
 s-castro-theatre-2027/
END:VEVENT
